=== Serialization ===
Process of convert a object (with his attributes and states) to an array of bytes to persist or share it
In this process you will works with an array of bytes (low level), generally you will use an subclass from Stream
+ A class only can be serialized if she implements Serializable
+ To don't serialize a attribute or state of class, you have to add the keyword "transient"

== Deserialization ==
The process of reading data that was serialized (parse to object)
+ Parse to object without call constructor (may affect subclasses)
